    {
      "duration_ms": 10000,
      "caption": "Dirtiness propagates downstream; restat stops it when an output did not actually change.",
      "narration": "Dirty marks propagate along edges to dependents. With the restat flag, ninja re-checks the output timestamp after the command and skips downstream work if nothing changed.",
      "elements": [
        {
